   "seed": 671884980,
   "text": "Void is the ONLY correction mechanism for posted documents (ADR-005) \u2014 it applies identically to stock transactions, receipts, orders, payments and expenses.\nA void_reason is mandatory and is written to audit_logs alongside the user and timestamp. Nothing in BOMS is ever edited after posting, and nothing is ever deleted.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Void is the ONLY correction mechanism for posted documents (ADR-005) \u2014 it applies identically to stock transactions, receipts, orders, payments and expenses.\nA void_reason is mandatory and is written to audit_logs alongside the user and timestamp. Nothing in BOMS is ever edited after posting, and nothing is ever deleted.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "customData": {
    "spec": true
   }
  },
